    "body": "I think we're very inconsistent on when we use class=brief. I tend to disprefer it myself just out of a subjective feeling that the current styling is too cramped. But I would be fine if we made up some more rigorous rule.\r\n\r\nFor this PR, I'll try to mostly leave the `brief` question untouched. (Although I'll remove it from the `complete` getter because those are relatively long sentences.)",
